Chapter 7: Working Principle
LM35 measures room temperature.
Arduino converts analog voltage into temperature.
Temperature is compared with preset limits.
Arduino generates PWM signals.
L293D drives the motor.
Fan speed increases as temperature increases.
When the temperature becomes low, the fan slows down.
